abstract: >-
  Reference implementation, gas measurements, and ZK prover bench for
  TallyMesh: an application-layer protocol that binds EIP-712 session intent,
  signed receipts, escrow, registries, and per-batch settlement-mode dispatch
  (optimistic Merkle-root publication or Groth16 ZK admission) into an
  auditable off-chain transcript. Distributed under MIT except for the
  snarkjs-generated Groth16 verifier (GPL-3.0); see NOTICE.
